[00:29.29] "I'll try", she said as he walked away
[00:33.69] "Try not to lose you"
[00:36.42] Two vibrant hearts could change
[00:39.93] Nothing tears the being more than deception, unmasked fear
[00:44.08] I'll be here waiting, tested and secure
[00:51.63] 
[01:00.65] Nothing hurts my world, just affects the ones around me
[01:05.64] When sin's deep in my blood, you'll be the one to fall
[01:11.10] I wish I could be the one
[01:15.89] The one who won't care at all
[01:21.22] But being the one on the stand
[01:25.78] I know the way to go, no one's guiding me
[01:31.65] When time soaked with blood turns it's back
[01:36.62] I know it's hard to fall
[01:42.01] Confided in me was your heart
[01:46.42] I know it's hurting you, but it's killing me
[01:53.50] 
